/*
 * Tree files support.
 *
 * An export is stored as a tree of small block files rather than as
 * one large file. The export data is split into TREEPAGESIZE-byte
 * blocks; each block lives in its own file. The block files are
 * spread over a tree of directories, with at most TREEDIRSIZE files
 * or subdirectories per directory, so that filesystems that do not
 * handle large files (or large directories) well can still be used
